<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25823" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lāŏdĭcēa</span></b> ,
			ae, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λαοδίκεια</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the name of several cities</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>In Cœle-Syria, near Lebanon</i>, now <i>Jusy</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 1,
			12</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>In Phrygia Major</i>, also called <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lāŏdĭcīa</span></b> , and
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Laudĭcēa</span></b> , now <i>Eski
				Hissar</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Fam. 2, 17, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">15, 4,
			2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 5, 28, 29, § 105</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vulg.
				Apoc. 1, 11 al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lāŏdĭcensis</span></b> ,
			e, <i>adj., of</i> or <i>belonging to Laodicea, Laodicean</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">civitas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Fam. 5</span></i>
			. 20, 2; 13, 67, 1.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lāŏdĭcēni</span></b> 
				(<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lau-dĭcēni</span></b> , Cass. ap. <i><span class="en">Cic. Fam.
				12, 13, 4</span></i>, v. h. l.), ōrum,
				m., <i>inhabitants of Laodicea</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				5, 23, 19, § 82</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
